	description "In addition to being able to recover their shields more quickly and efficiently than any other technology of considerable size, Quarg shield generators also provide an impressive degree of protection against weapons designed to bypass shields entirely."


outfit "Aegis Shield Generator"
	category "Systems"
	series "Shields"
	index 91030
	cost 12500000
	thumbnail "outfit/quarg aegis shield generator"
	"mass" 80
	"outfit space" -80
	"shield generation" 10
	"shield energy" 5
	"disruption protection" .5
	"piercing protection" 1
	description "The first humans who met the Quarg thought that their technology worked on magic, and many even think so to this day. The mechanism by which this Quarg shield generator works is completely unknown to humanity, providing an astounding amount of protection, and the Quarg aren't interested in giving up the secrets behind it."


outfit "Peripheral Repair Hub"
	category "Systems"
	series "Repair"
	index 91010
	cost 2000000
	thumbnail "outfit/quarg peripheral repair hub"
	"mass" 25
	"outfit space" -25
	"fuel generation" 0.025
	"hull repair rate" 1
	"hull energy" .5
	description "The repair systems employed by the Quarg operate in ways that seem to defy reality, somehow gathering matter and injecting it into a ship's hull and fuel systems. This provides essential maintenance that benefits core aspects of spaceflight - durability, longevity, and most importantly, survivability."


outfit "Central Repair Hub"
	category "Systems"
	series "Repair"
	index 91020
	cost 5000000
	thumbnail "outfit/quarg central repair hub"
	"mass" 55
	"outfit space" -55
	"fuel generation" 0.07
	"hull repair rate" 2.5
	"hull energy" 1.25
	description "In a manner which is not easily discernible to humans, this system collects ambient matter in space and feeds it back to the ship from a large central hub of wires and tubes. The accumulated matter is then used to both regenerate the ship's hull and refill its fuel reserves."


