			"frame rate" 20
		sound "slipstream projector"
		"inaccuracy" .1
		"velocity" 500
		"lifetime" 1
		"reload" 1
		"firing energy" 30
		"firing heat" 2
		"hit force" -400
		"shield damage" 30
		"penetration count" 100
	description "While the exact workings of graviton tech are a mystery, it's no secret that this device manipulates gravity in such a wondrous way that it even bends the massive architecture of ringworlds to its whim. While the force is not enough to harm the delicate structure, the negative energy is powerful enough to rip off the shielding of a ship in a remarkably short period of time."


# Special

outfit "Phalanx System"
	category "Hand to Hand"
	series "Fortifications"
	index 91010
	thumbnail "outfit/quarg countermeasures"
	"capture defense" 36
	"unplunderable" 1
	description "With an abundance of caution regarding the potential theft and misuse of their technology, Quarg ships are outfitted with special systems for repelling boarders in a manner that could be considered overkill. Because no one wants to be caught by the Quarg with stolen technology, these systems are pretty much worthless on the open market."
